y=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">μ</text><line x1=\"291.2\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"291.2\" y2=\"189\" stroke=\"#6b7260\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"291.2\" y=\"202.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#6b7260\">80</text><text x=\"291.2\" y=\"215.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">μ+σ</text><line x1=\"343.5\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"343.5\" y2=\"189\" stroke=\"#6b7260\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"343.5\" y=\"202.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#6b7260\">88</text><text x=\"343.5\" y=\"215.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">μ+2σ</text><line x1=\"239.0\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"239.0\" y2=\"184\" stroke=\"#c17f2b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"291.2\" y1=\"88.2\" x2=\"291.2\" y2=\"184\" stroke=\"#234539\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"296.2\" y=\"83.2\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">80</text><text x=\"369.6\" y=\"170.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">15,9 %</text><text x=\"454.0\" y=\"16.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6b7260\">punt</text></svg>",
     "onderschrift": "N(72; 8) met de rechterstaart vanaf 80: dat is de 0,159 uit de tabel hierboven."
